  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      113.52,
      454.2,
      307.79,
      476.39
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: fldm%df,a$bw;a/3/20/NH.Land Ministry's Reference No: L/03/96/NH/382.",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbhayax",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070319175720215,
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.8,
      484.32,
      308.12,
      530.39
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964(Amendment), thatthe Government intends to acquire the following land whichis required for a Public Purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.88,
      539.52,
      243.45,
      549.59
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.8,
      558.72,
      308.01,
      640.79
    ],
    "text": "Two allotments of land in Total Extent of about 0.1166Hectare depicted as lots 1 to 2 in the Preliminary Plan No. Co.9823 dated 20.06.2019 situated in the Village calledPanchikawatta (Ward No. 25 within Colombo MunicipalCouncil limit) in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofColombo in Colombo District of the Western Province andmorefully described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.8,
      654.72,
      307.99,
      700.79
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Assessment No. 175/40, 191/20 andother Sahir Cassim and Hajiyar Place; Description: Homegarden, Two permanent two storied buildings are available;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      395.04,
      560.2,
      416.15
    ],
    "text": "Original Claimant: State;Claimant: W.T.Hemarathna, SittiSuleina and some others; Extent: 0.0905 Hec.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      423.12,
      560.42,
      466.07
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 02Name of the Land: Assessment number not available;Description: Road; Original Claimant: State;Claimant: couldnot be traced; Extent: 0.0261 Hec.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      473.04,
      560.76,
      571.19
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested, in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing, before me at the Colombo Divisional Secretariaton 06th December, 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requestedto notify to me in writing in duplicate on or before 27thNovember, 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said lands, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.754525661468506,
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      576.96,
      560.28,
      598.07
    ],
    "text": "All deeds and documents in support of the claims shouldbe produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
